	<section_number>18.2-260.1</section_number>
	<catch_line>Falsifying patient records</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any person who, with the intent to defraud, falsifies any patient record shall be guilty of a Class 1 misdemeanor.
	</text>
	<history>1997, c. 619; 2011, c. 204.</history>
